        { texto: '<b>CEPI</b> (19 mayo 2026). <em>European Union and Singapore Back CEPI\'s Plan to Boost Global Defences.</em>', url: 'https://cepi.net/european-union-and-singapore-back-cepis-plan-boost-global-defences-against-epidemic-and-pandemic' },
        { texto: 'Piezas vinculadas del programa: <em>Capitalismo de preparación pandémica</em> (20-may), <em>Guadalajara, 23 de junio</em> (21-may), <em>El subsuelo del brote</em> (22-may), <em>El virus equivocado en portada</em> (24-may), <em>La constelación del 22 de mayo</em> (27-may).' }
